  "sql_pattern": "-- Find orders in OMS but not in Settlement (unsettled)\nSELECT o.order_id, o.charged_amount, o.created_date\nFROM zs_observe.healthkart_oms o\nLEFT JOIN zs_observe.healthkart_settlement s\n  ON o.order_id = s.order_id AND s.is_active = true\nWHERE o.is_active = true AND s.order_id IS NULL",
